    "description": "DeepSeek Harness 插件：华为云 CodeArts 浏览器登录与凭据管理，并把 CodeBuddy / WorkBuddy / LobsterAI / Qoder / TRAE / Cline / Loomy / Raccoon / MiniMax / TeleAgent / ZCode / Step Code / Antigravity 注册为 LLM 提供商，含多账号池、静默续期、额度与每日签到。"
